## Undocumented rules

The rules that exist only in someone's head. These are the highest-value rows in the engagement.

**A note on care:** the rule exists because the official process is inadequate. Surfacing it can look like surfacing a workaround the holder is responsible for. Frame every one of these as a process finding, never as individual behaviour.

